BNA","overview":"Morphed into a raccoon beastman, Michiru seeks refuge, and answers, with the aid of wolf beastman Shirou inside the special zone of Anima-City.","tagline":"Become someone new."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"21世紀、それまで歴史の闇に隠れていた獣人達がその存在を明らかにし始めていた。普通の人間だった影森みちるは、ある日突然タヌキ獣人になってしまう。人間たちから逃れるために向かった獣人特区『アニマシティ』は、十年前に獣人が獣人らしく生きるために作られた獣人のための街。そこで人間嫌いのオオカミ獣人・大神士郎と出会ったみちるは、彼と行動を共にするなかで、人間の世界にいた頃には知らなかった『獣人たち』の悩みや生活、喜びを学んでいく。なぜ、みちるは獣人になってしまったのか。その謎を追ううちに、予想もしていなかった大きな出来事に巻き込まれていくのだった。","tagline":"私は変わる、世界を変える。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1QfvxcMLEDnDZOFCqNQGgIscfV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a1QfvxcMLEDnDZOFCqNQGgIscfV.png","language":"en","width":621,"height":243},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AvqKXLszQliuWYffFVttUzgbsM8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AvqKXLszQliuWYffFVttUzgbsM8.png","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":736},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6VGeePP9I2EANEKTTipbip8J7zV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6VGeePP9I2EANEKTTipbip8J7zV.png","language":"ja","width":542,"height":219},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xKXlGQxBKb4ueLWrcEGwrkT3nUE.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xKXlGQxBKb4ueLWrcEGwrkT3nUE.png","language":"ja","width":1600,"height":602}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fwFYXaQz0mrY8v1HDky2wJsYa7t.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fwFYXaQz0mrY8v1HDky2wJsYa7t.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Djmax09nDZNODBO8gsr63jNHZ5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Djmax09nDZNODBO8gsr63jNHZ5.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aBHTLSFXaVwX2adUzTA4crxlZef.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aBHTLSFXaVwX2adUzTA